1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,334
Leave gracefully.

2
00:00:01,376 --> 00:00:03,085
[KARA] Or I’ll expose
your company for bribery.

3
00:00:03,086 --> 00:00:04,504
You know,
in this digital age?

4
00:00:04,546 --> 00:00:07,047
[PAUL] We wouldn't want
people to find out that…

5
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:08,882
you were the face
of your ex's company.

6
00:00:08,883 --> 00:00:09,884
What does that make you?

7
00:00:09,926 --> 00:00:10,926
A hypocrite?

8
00:00:10,927 --> 00:00:12,929
Release it.
Make sure it’s during peak hours.

9
00:00:12,971 --> 00:00:14,471
[ARIEL SPEAKS SIARGAONON]
Oh, my god!

10
00:00:14,472 --> 00:00:18,184
“Hypocrite. She only used
the island for her own interests.”

11
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:20,603
People need to hear
your side of the story.

12
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:23,022
[KARA] Everything said about
me in the viral video is true.

13
00:00:23,064 --> 00:00:24,773
But I'm here now,

14
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:26,900
not to clear my name,

15
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:29,612
but to fight to protect
the environment.

16
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:32,031
You didn't inform me you
were going to do a livestream.

17
00:00:32,073 --> 00:00:33,450
I can handle myself, Jao.

18
00:00:33,491 --> 00:00:35,784
You might as well just
say you don't need me.

19
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:36,786
[KARA]
I need you.

20
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:38,621
But not for the
reasons you think.

21
00:00:38,663 --> 00:00:42,041
Sir, I think we have to
consider looking into alternatives

22
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:43,584
on how we can
develop the area.

23
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:44,711
So I'm proposing...

24
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:48,380
that we should build a
sustainable eco-resort.

25
00:00:48,381 --> 00:00:50,799
Kara, Headquarters is
asking for your contact info.

26
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,304
They want to offer you the
international field officer position.

27
00:00:54,345 --> 00:00:56,346
You're going
international, Kara!

28
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:58,975
But if I accept it,
do I have to leave the island?

29
00:01:11,738 --> 00:01:12,738
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

30
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:14,741
[DOOR OPENS]

31
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,285
[DOOR CREAKS OPEN]

32
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,622
[DOOR CLOSES]

33
00:01:23,458 --> 00:01:24,459
Thanks.

34
00:01:28,046 --> 00:01:31,632
So, Architect Zulueta
is setting up a meeting

35
00:01:31,633 --> 00:01:33,967
with Team Pure Coast
to discuss the

36
00:01:33,968 --> 00:01:38,181
integration of the mangrove
plantation into the eco-resort plan.

37
00:01:38,556 --> 00:01:40,266
Sure.
Anytime.

38
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:46,940
Thank you, Jao,
for staying true to your word.

39
00:01:48,316 --> 00:01:50,109
You really were on my side.

40
00:01:51,736 --> 00:01:53,529
Actually, congratulations to us.

41
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:55,740
Our CEO saw...

42
00:01:55,782 --> 00:01:57,449
your viral confession video.

43
00:01:57,450 --> 00:01:58,451
[KARA]
Hm?

44
00:01:58,535 --> 00:02:01,913
And that was actually
one of the deciding factors

45
00:02:02,288 --> 00:02:03,790
on why he said yes to

46
00:02:03,832 --> 00:02:07,502
build a sustainable, mangrove-friendly
eco-resort in Cabitoonan.

47
00:02:09,504 --> 00:02:10,630
You know, Jao…

48
00:02:11,464 --> 00:02:15,676
I was willing to expose the
irregularities of your company

49
00:02:15,677 --> 00:02:17,971
even knowing you'd
get caught up in it.

50
00:02:19,806 --> 00:02:20,807
Turns out…

51
00:02:20,849 --> 00:02:22,641
your boss is really good
at covering his tracks.

52
00:02:22,642 --> 00:02:24,352
[JAO CHUCKLES SOFTLY]

53
00:02:24,686 --> 00:02:26,603
You could've just asked
me yourself, you know?

54
00:02:26,604 --> 00:02:28,940
I know where all
the bodies are, and...

55
00:02:29,315 --> 00:02:30,733
I have receipts.

56
00:02:30,817 --> 00:02:31,817
[KARA SCOFFS]

57
00:02:31,818 --> 00:02:35,029
I really don't know why
you're taking this so lightly.

58
00:02:35,864 --> 00:02:38,074
I almost chose the
mangroves over you.

59
00:02:38,616 --> 00:02:39,659
Do you get that?

60
00:02:39,993 --> 00:02:42,328
[JAO CHUCKLES]

61
00:02:43,454 --> 00:02:45,248
Because, Kara,
I understand you.

62
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:47,959
I knew the moment
you learned that...

63
00:02:48,001 --> 00:02:49,794
Young Horizon was
handling the project

64
00:02:49,836 --> 00:02:52,005
and I was going to
be the project head,

65
00:02:52,046 --> 00:02:54,132
I knew you'd want
me to resign

66
00:02:54,173 --> 00:02:56,551
and join you in
taking down my boss.

67
00:02:57,135 --> 00:03:00,221
But I realized I
couldn't do that

68
00:03:00,763 --> 00:03:02,557
because I know
how he works.

69
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:06,978
And I'd have more leverage
if I stayed on his team.

70
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,897
And at the same time,

71
00:03:09,063 --> 00:03:12,483
I could protect the
mangroves and you.

72
00:03:13,651 --> 00:03:15,612
You know I can handle myself.

73
00:03:18,031 --> 00:03:19,032
I know.

74
00:03:21,367 --> 00:03:22,368
[JAO] But…

75
00:03:24,245 --> 00:03:25,538
I’m here now.

76
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:28,333
You’re not alone anymore.

77
00:03:31,669 --> 00:03:34,172
I'm just a little
disappointed because...

78
00:03:35,298 --> 00:03:38,301
I was willing to sacrifice
us for the cause.

79
00:03:41,262 --> 00:03:42,262
Let’s not…

80
00:03:42,263 --> 00:03:45,266
Let’s not dwell on things
that haven't happened yet.

81
00:03:46,976 --> 00:03:49,604
What matters is
we're in this together.

82
00:03:50,772 --> 00:03:53,441
To protect the island
and the mangroves.

83
00:03:54,192 --> 00:03:56,486
And most especially,
to protect each other.

84
00:04:02,283 --> 00:04:06,746
[ALON BY JL]

85
00:05:26,951 --> 00:05:29,453
[PEARL SCREAMS EXCITEDLY]

86
00:05:29,454 --> 00:05:31,456
Oh, my god!
[PEARL GASPS]

87
00:05:32,248 --> 00:05:34,666
- [PHONE RINGS]
- Pearl.

88
00:05:34,667 --> 00:05:36,001
[PEARL ON THE PHONE]
OMG! OMG!

89
00:05:36,002 --> 00:05:38,087
- [PEARL ON THE PHONE] OMG!
- [SIARGAONON] What is it?

90
00:05:38,171 --> 00:05:40,757
- [SIARGAONON] Calm down!
- [PEARL ON THE PHONE] Ariel!

91
00:05:40,798 --> 00:05:44,009
Ariel, I got accepted!
I got the scholarship!

92
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:45,803
[ARIEL SPEAKS SIARGAONON]
Wow! Really?

93
00:05:45,845 --> 00:05:46,846
Oh!

94
00:05:47,055 --> 00:05:48,765
[ARIEL SPEAKS SIARGAONON]
Is it true, Pearl?

95
00:05:48,973 --> 00:05:52,185
[PEARL ON THE PHONE]
I thought this dream was a shot in the dark!

96
00:05:52,268 --> 00:05:54,687
[SIARGAONON]
I'm so proud of you, Pearl!

97
00:05:54,729 --> 00:05:56,105
I'm so, so proud of you.

98
00:05:56,147 --> 00:05:58,149
[ARIEL SPEAKS SIARGAONON ON THE PHONE]
You're something else!

99
00:05:58,691 --> 00:06:00,777
I'm just glad someone
believed in me.

100
00:06:00,818 --> 00:06:02,819
Besides you, Mom, and Kara.

101
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,322
[ARIEL]
Of course, Pearl!

102
00:06:04,906 --> 00:06:06,406
Wow!
Congratulations!

103
00:06:06,407 --> 00:06:08,034
[SIARGAONON]
We’re going to celebrate!

104
00:06:08,743 --> 00:06:10,203
Ariel...
[PEARL STUTTERS]

105
00:06:10,244 --> 00:06:11,953
Wait, I just need to
do something, okay?

106
00:06:11,954 --> 00:06:14,540
But thank you, Lord!
[PEARL GIGGLES]

107
00:06:14,665 --> 00:06:15,666
Bye!

108
00:06:31,015 --> 00:06:33,017
[PEARL BREATHES HEAVILY]

109
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:42,068
[PEARL BREATHES HEAVILY]

110
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,658
Hi, Sir Han!

111
00:06:49,617 --> 00:06:51,035
I mean...

112
00:06:52,286 --> 00:06:53,788
Song Ji Hoon.

113
00:06:56,290 --> 00:06:59,001
You know what?
It actually doesn't matter who you are.

114
00:07:03,339 --> 00:07:04,841
I just wanna thank you.

115
00:07:08,052 --> 00:07:09,262
Thank you...

116
00:07:09,762 --> 00:07:11,472
for believing in me.

117
00:07:14,016 --> 00:07:17,019
Thank you for making me
feel that my dreams are valid.

118
00:07:22,358 --> 00:07:23,776
Thank you...

119
00:07:25,444 --> 00:07:27,113
for seeing my worth.

120
00:07:29,282 --> 00:07:32,285
Because, Sir Han, I got accepted!
[PEARL LAUGHS]

121
00:07:33,452 --> 00:07:34,954
All thanks to you!

122
00:07:37,999 --> 00:07:39,500
You made me believe

123
00:07:40,710 --> 00:07:42,378
that this island girl

124
00:07:43,504 --> 00:07:45,339
can go out in the big world.

125
00:07:49,177 --> 00:07:50,678
And I'm so happy!

126
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:54,140
[PEARL LAUGHS]

127
00:08:00,521 --> 00:08:02,106
But I also hate you.

128
00:08:07,737 --> 00:08:11,532
I hate that you're not answering
my calls or my messages.

129
00:08:15,536 --> 00:08:19,248
I just want to make
sure if your family is okay.

130
00:08:20,541 --> 00:08:22,168
If you're okay.

131
00:08:26,881 --> 00:08:27,882
I hate that…

132
00:08:27,924 --> 00:08:30,342
[PEARL CRIES]

133
00:08:30,343 --> 00:08:33,346
that you're not here
to celebrate with me.

134
00:08:37,433 --> 00:08:38,476
[PEARL SNIFFS]

135
00:08:40,061 --> 00:08:41,437
And I hate you also

136
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:42,480
[PEARL CRIES]

137
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:46,359
for telling me
that you like me

138
00:08:46,859 --> 00:08:49,862
then leave without even
asking me if I like you back.

139
00:08:56,494 --> 00:08:57,494
‘Cause I do.

140
00:08:57,495 --> 00:08:58,496
[PEARL CRIES]

141
00:09:02,458 --> 00:09:03,459
You know…

142
00:09:06,504 --> 00:09:07,546
scratch that.

143
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:09,840
[PEARL SNIFFS]

144
00:09:09,841 --> 00:09:11,133
I lied.

145
00:09:16,847 --> 00:09:18,557
I don’t just like you.

146
00:09:25,439 --> 00:09:27,066
I love you, Sir Han.

147
00:09:30,361 --> 00:09:32,363
I love you so much.
[PEARL SOBS]

148
00:09:34,532 --> 00:09:35,408
[PEARL CRIES]

149
00:09:35,409 --> 00:09:38,827
And it really hurts that you’re not
here because I miss you so much.

150
00:09:38,828 --> 00:09:39,829
[PEARL SOBS]

151
00:09:43,666 --> 00:09:44,667
[PEARL SNIFFS]

152
00:09:47,211 --> 00:09:51,215
[PEARL BREATHES HEAVILY]

153
00:09:57,722 --> 00:09:59,223
[PEARL BREATHES HEAVILY]

154
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:14,280
So?

155
00:10:14,780 --> 00:10:16,073
Are you giving up?

156
00:10:22,872 --> 00:10:24,457
What's on your mind?

157
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,502
Carol, do you think Jao
will ever really know me?

158
00:10:28,544 --> 00:10:30,755
I don’t even know myself.

159
00:10:33,758 --> 00:10:36,552
We’re obviously two
very different people.

160
00:10:37,053 --> 00:10:40,264
We're just caught up in our emotions
and everything happening on the island.

161
00:10:41,182 --> 00:10:42,600
[CAROL]
Kara...

162
00:10:42,933 --> 00:10:44,935
you're both adults.

163
00:10:45,269 --> 00:10:47,271
Caught up in your emotions?

164
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:49,273
What you mean is,

165
00:10:49,774 --> 00:10:52,568
the honeymoon phase
with Jao is over.

166
00:10:53,569 --> 00:10:56,697
And now you're
experiencing reality.

167
00:11:00,409 --> 00:11:02,286
What exactly is the problem?

168
00:11:03,996 --> 00:11:07,291
All this time,
I know I’m just hiding behind Kara.

169
00:11:09,418 --> 00:11:12,296
But after everything
that’s happened, I realized

170
00:11:13,089 --> 00:11:15,091
I want to figure out
who I am.

171
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,345
What do you mean?

172
00:11:21,472 --> 00:11:23,891
Han shared a quote with me.

173
00:11:23,933 --> 00:11:24,934
[CAROL]
Hm?

174
00:11:25,518 --> 00:11:28,437
He learned it from a
Buddhist monk he once met.

175
00:11:29,939 --> 00:11:32,400
It’s the philosophy of meta.

176
00:11:32,942 --> 00:11:33,943
[CAROL]
Meta?

177
00:11:34,693 --> 00:11:36,987
Meta?
What does that mean?

178
00:11:39,073 --> 00:11:40,074
It means...

179
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:43,827
wishing someone well
even though that person

180
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:46,455
will have a completely
different journey than yours.

181
00:11:48,707 --> 00:11:50,709
Because love
is not possession.

182
00:11:53,045 --> 00:11:54,088
It's freedom.

183
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:22,032
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

184
00:12:22,033 --> 00:12:23,033
Kara.

185
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:29,957
These are the latest renders
Architect Zulueta sent for the project.

186
00:12:30,332 --> 00:12:31,333
Um...

187
00:12:31,375 --> 00:12:33,878
The mangroves are fully
integrated into the design already.

188
00:12:34,295 --> 00:12:37,965
Noah's taken a look at it several times
and we've gone through several revisions.

189
00:12:39,884 --> 00:12:41,969
You don't have
to show me this.

190
00:12:42,428 --> 00:12:44,430
I know, but...

191
00:12:45,222 --> 00:12:47,224
I want you to see
the whole process...

192
00:12:47,641 --> 00:12:49,518
and how the project
is progressing.

193
00:12:50,603 --> 00:12:52,104
I know you still have...

194
00:12:52,438 --> 00:12:55,024
reservations about
the project, Kara, but…

195
00:12:56,442 --> 00:12:57,943
I just want you to know

196
00:12:58,569 --> 00:13:00,154
I'm grateful for your support.

197
00:13:04,158 --> 00:13:05,868
Can I ask you something?

198
00:13:06,285 --> 00:13:07,286
Sure.

199
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:10,789
Did you...

200
00:13:10,915 --> 00:13:14,210
resign from the Cabitoonan
project because of me?

201
00:13:14,251 --> 00:13:15,836
[KARA CLICKS TONGUE]
No!

202
00:13:15,878 --> 00:13:17,171
[KARA LAUGHS]

203
00:13:17,213 --> 00:13:18,505
I didn't resign, either.

204
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:20,841
I'm just focusing on
Del Carmen for now.

205
00:13:22,426 --> 00:13:24,428
That’s good to know,
and, uh…

206
00:13:24,803 --> 00:13:26,430
I promise you, all the...

207
00:13:26,639 --> 00:13:28,890
environmental and
development programs

208
00:13:28,891 --> 00:13:31,100
we promised Cabitoonan,

209
00:13:31,101 --> 00:13:32,520
we will fulfill them.

210
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:36,315
And all the compliance,
everything that comes with it,

211
00:13:36,899 --> 00:13:38,901
I'll personally make sure
we stay on top of it all, Kara.

212
00:13:39,151 --> 00:13:40,361
I promise.

213
00:13:41,487 --> 00:13:43,489
You don't have
to convince me.

214
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,408
[TANTAN]
Sir Handsome!

215
00:13:46,867 --> 00:13:48,576
Hey, Tantan!

216
00:13:48,577 --> 00:13:50,579
Sir Handsome!
Ma'am Kara!

217
00:13:50,704 --> 00:13:52,206
[JAO AND KARA LAUGH]

218
00:13:52,248 --> 00:13:54,458
Okay,
I would like you to meet...

219
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:59,213
the first official hire
of Isla Gugma Resort.

220
00:13:59,797 --> 00:14:00,798
Tantan.

221
00:14:01,924 --> 00:14:04,634
Sir Handsome,
do I really have to wear a uniform?

222
00:14:04,635 --> 00:14:05,636
I'm not used to it.

223
00:14:05,678 --> 00:14:06,678
Oh, come on.

224
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:08,681
[KARA] It’s nice!
You look handsome!

225
00:14:08,722 --> 00:14:09,931
[JAO]
Better get used to it.

226
00:14:09,932 --> 00:14:10,933
[TANTAN]
Used to what?

227
00:14:10,975 --> 00:14:14,978
The uniform or being handsome?

228
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,397
[KARA]
Yes.

229
00:14:16,981 --> 00:14:17,981
Can I hit him?

230
00:14:17,982 --> 00:14:21,193
[TANTAN AND KARA LAUGH]

231
00:14:45,092 --> 00:14:48,095
[ARIEL] Why won't you
let us take you to Manila?

232
00:14:49,471 --> 00:14:53,558
Because you'll just
cry there anyway.

233
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:56,394
Might as well stay here
and save your tears, right?

234
00:14:56,395 --> 00:14:58,439
Hm.
I’m not crying.

235
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,482
[CAROL SNIFFS]

236
00:15:00,524 --> 00:15:01,691
[CAROL]
Pearl...

237
00:15:01,692 --> 00:15:03,694
stay strong, okay?

238
00:15:03,944 --> 00:15:05,446
[SIARGAONON]
Be strong.

239
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:07,780
- Of course, Mom.
- [CAROL CRIES]

240
00:15:07,781 --> 00:15:09,407
[SIARGAONON]
Take care, Princess Pearl.

241
00:15:09,408 --> 00:15:11,910
[CRYING]

242
00:15:15,539 --> 00:15:17,916
- Take a shot for me, Mom!
- Yes! Of course!

243
00:15:17,958 --> 00:15:19,250
[CAROL AND PEARL LAUGH]

244
00:15:19,251 --> 00:15:22,087
If you need anything,
just text or call, okay?

245
00:15:23,088 --> 00:15:25,090
Jao, take care, okay?

246
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:26,925
I'm proud of you.

247
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:30,137
You got to do
what you wanted.

248
00:15:34,141 --> 00:15:36,310
You did, too, Kara.

249
00:15:36,685 --> 00:15:38,479
And whatever else
you set your mind to,

250
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:39,897
you will achieve it!

251
00:15:39,938 --> 00:15:41,440
You’re Kara!

252
00:15:41,482 --> 00:15:43,442
[KARA AND PEARL LAUGH]

253
00:15:43,692 --> 00:15:44,693
[HAN BIN]
Pearl!

254
00:15:47,488 --> 00:15:48,697
[PEARL]
Sir Han?

255
00:15:49,156 --> 00:15:50,156
Sir Han!

256
00:15:50,157 --> 00:15:51,575
Hey!

257
00:16:11,345 --> 00:16:12,470
When did you get back?

258
00:16:12,471 --> 00:16:14,264
I can't miss this
for the world.

259
00:16:14,306 --> 00:16:16,809
Sir Han, why aren't you
answering your phone calls?

260
00:16:16,850 --> 00:16:17,851
Pearl...

261
00:16:18,143 --> 00:16:19,144
[KOREAN]
I love you.

262
00:16:19,561 --> 00:16:20,646
Sir Han.

263
00:16:20,896 --> 00:16:23,023
I got accepted into the
scholarship, Sir Han.

264
00:16:23,065 --> 00:16:23,982
I know.

265
00:16:24,024 --> 00:16:26,026
We can give a lot
of people jobs here.

266
00:16:26,068 --> 00:16:27,236
[JAO]
Kara? Surprise visit?

267
00:16:27,277 --> 00:16:29,780
Is Sir Paul really gone?

268
00:16:29,822 --> 00:16:31,323
Officially fired last week.

269
00:16:31,657 --> 00:16:34,451
Well, as long as I'm around,
no one can hurt you.

270
00:16:34,702 --> 00:16:36,495
I'll let you know my
decision by Friday.

271
00:16:36,537 --> 00:16:39,498
[CAROL] You know
I support you, right?

272
00:16:39,748 --> 00:16:41,750
Wherever you decide to go.

273
00:16:42,292 --> 00:16:43,711
- [KARA] Are you happy?
- [JAO] Yeah.

274
00:16:43,752 --> 00:16:45,212
[JAO]
Because finally, I'm home.

275
00:16:45,254 --> 00:16:47,047
And everything I need is here.

276
00:16:47,089 --> 00:16:48,882
The island. You.

277
00:16:48,924 --> 00:16:51,009
Jao, I'm leaving Siargao.

278
00:16:52,761 --> 00:16:53,971
Please, Kara, don't.

279
00:16:54,346 --> 00:16:55,556
Not now.
